<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Colly Cotton half yr net A$4.17 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Colly Cotton half yr net A$4.17 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   4.23 vs  0.25</p>
<p>    Net				    4.17 vs  0.25</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   1.0  vs  n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Colly Cotton Ltd, an integrated cotton producer and marketer, was floated on the Australian Stock Exchange last October. The results to December 31, 1996 relate to the finalisation of the 1996 harvest. The operating profit represents 20 percent of the A$21.4 million forecast profit for the 12 months to June 30, 1997, the company said.  </p>
<p>    Sales				 217.07  vs 171.53</p>
<p>    Other income			  3.01  vs   1.26</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   3.90  vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>Dividend is nil franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 25</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>    Tax					nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Interest expense		    7.15  vs   3.98</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  3.44  vs   2.55</p>
<p>    Minorities			    0.06  vs   0.02</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
